# headwear/helm/crest/comb: the forge crest accent `comb` (STYLE_P2 28.3, contracts 3c: overlay crest.<v>, anchor crown)
# FOUNDRY: the Greek comb: a tall cast crest standing on a short stalk front to back, a lit cap and a dark crease,
# its tail sweeping down behind the nape (a statue's helm). From the front a tall flat-topped blade with a groove.
# Written by the FORGE-HELM area's tools/gen.py from src/ (the hand-drawn D U R views; L is R re-lit). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
body adult
role overlay crest.comb
layer headwear
anchor crown
keys hatpose
z 2
tags overlay
legend v metal 0
legend w metal 1
legend x metal 2
legend y metal 3
legend z metal 4
